    "summary": "Level 40 and 60 riding costs, the Honored discount, the free first mount, and trainer and vendor coordinates for every race.",
    "content": "### Overview: Costs and Levels\n\n| Skill | Level | Speed | Training | Mount |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **Apprentice Riding** | 40 | +60% | 100g | 20g, **first one free** |\n| **Journeyman Riding** | 60 | +100% | 1,000g | 200g, **first one free** |\n\n- **Save 10%:** be **Honored** with your race's faction before you train. That is 10g at 40 and **100g at 60**.\n- **Don't buy your first mount.** After each skill, your race's vendor gives you one for free.\n- **Paladins and Warlocks** get a mount and the matching riding skill from class quests at 40 and 60.\n- **Another race's mount** needs Exalted with that race plus 100g for its riding style.\n- Learned mounts are in Account Collections (Shift+P).\n\n💡 Saving for 60? See the [gold guide](#guides/guide-gold-making-60) and the [level 60 checklist](#guides/guide-level-60-checklist). All mounts are listed in the Codex.\n\n---\n\n### Alliance\n\n#### Human\n\n| What | Where / Which |\n|---|---|\n| **Trainer** | Randal Hunter, Eastvale Logging Camp, Elwynn (`84.2, 65.0`) |\n| **Mounts** | Katie Hunter (`84.0, 65.4`) |\n| **Level 40 (60%)** | [Chestnut Mare Bridle](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=5655), [Brown Horse Bridle](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=5656), [Pinto Bridle](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=2414) |\n| **Level 60 (100%)** | [Swift Palomino](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18776), [Swift Brown Steed](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18777), [Swift White Steed](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18778) |\n\n💡 Unger Statforth in Wetlands (`8.6, 54.6`) also sells [Black Stallion Bridle](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=2411). His quest [Your First Horse](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=97171) can award it.\n\n#### Dwarf\n\n| What | Where / Which |\n|---|---|\n| **Trainer** | Ultham Ironhorn, Gol'Bolar Quarry, Dun Morogh (`63.8, 50.2`) |\n| **Mounts** | Veron Amberstill (`63.6, 50.6`) |\n| **Level 40 (60%)** | [Gray Ram](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=5864), [Brown Ram](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=5872), [White Ram](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=5873) |\n| **Level 60 (100%)** | [Swift Gray Ram](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18787), [Swift Brown Ram](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18786), [Swift White Ram](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18785) |\n\n#### Night Elf\n\n| What | Where / Which |\n|---|---|\n| **Trainer** | Jartsam, Darnassus (`38.6, 16.0`) |\n| **Mounts** | Lelanai (`38.6, 15.6`) |\n| **Level 40 (60%)** | [Reins of the Striped Nightsaber](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=8629), [Reins of the Striped Frostsaber](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=8631), [Reins of the Spotted Frostsaber](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=8632), [Reins of the Striped Dawnsaber](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274706) |\n| **Level 60 (100%)** | [Reins of the Swift Stormsaber](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18902), [Reins of the Swift Frostsaber](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18766), [Reins of the Swift Mistsaber](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18767) |\n\n#### Gnome\n\n| What | Where / Which |\n|---|---|\n| **Trainer** | Binjy Featherwhistle, Kharanos, Dun Morogh (`49.2, 48.0`) |\n| **Mounts** | Milli Featherwhistle, beside him |\n| **Level 40 (60%)** | [Red Mechanostrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=8563), [Blue Mechanostrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=8595), [Green Mechanostrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=13321), [Unpainted Mechanostrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=13322) |\n| **Level 60 (100%)** | [Swift Yellow Mechanostrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18774), [Swift White Mechanostrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18773), [Swift Green Mechanostrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18772) |\n\n### Horde\n\n#### Orc\n\n| What | Where / Which |\n|---|---|\n| **Trainer** | Kildar, Valley of Honor, Orgrimmar (`69.2, 13.2`) |\n| **Mounts** | Ogunaro Wolfrunner (`69.4, 12.4`) |\n| **Level 40 (60%)** | [Horn of the Timber Wolf](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=1132), [Horn of the Dire Wolf](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=5665), [Horn of the Brown Wolf](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=5668), [Horn of the Black Wolf](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=1041) |\n| **Level 60 (100%)** | [Horn of the Swift Timber Wolf](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18797), [Horn of the Swift Gray Wolf](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18798), [Horn of the Swift Brown Wolf](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18796) |\n\n#### Undead\n\n| What | Where / Which |\n|---|---|\n| **Trainer** | Velma Warnam, Brill, Tirisfal (`60.0, 52.6`) |\n| **Mounts** | Zachariah Post (`59.8, 52.6`) |\n| **Level 40 (60%)** | [Red Skeletal Horse](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=13331), [Blue Skeletal Horse](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=13332), [Brown Skeletal Horse](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=13333), [Black Skeletal Horse](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=276063) |\n| **Level 60 (100%)** | [Ochre Skeletal Warhorse](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274799), [Purple Skeletal Warhorse](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18791), [Green Skeletal Warhorse](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=13334) |\n\n#### Tauren\n\n| What | Where / Which |\n|---|---|\n| **Trainer** | Kar Stormsinger, Bloodhoof Village, Mulgore (`46.8, 61.8`) |\n| **Mounts** | Harb Clawhoof (`46.6, 62.0`) |\n| **Level 40 (60%)** | [Gray Kodo](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=15277), [Brown Kodo](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=15290), [White Kodo](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=275993) |\n| **Level 60 (100%)** | [Great Gray Kodo](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18795), [Great Brown Kodo](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18794), [Great White Kodo](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18793) |\n\n💡 Tylana Clawhoof in Stonetalon (`46.0, 59.8`) also sells [Lavender Kodo](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=277960). Her quest [Your First Riding Kodo](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=97446) can award it.\n\n#### Troll\n\n| What | Where / Which |\n|---|---|\n| **Trainer** | Xar'Ti, Sen'jin Village, Durotar (`55.2, 75.6`) |\n| **Mounts** | Zjolnir, beside him |\n| **Level 40 (60%)** | [Whistle of the Emerald Raptor](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=8588), [Whistle of the Turquoise Raptor](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=8591), [Whistle of the Violet Raptor](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=8592) |\n| **Level 60 (100%)** | [Swift Orange Raptor](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18790), [Swift Olive Raptor](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18789), [Swift Blue Raptor](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18788) |\n\n### Both Factions\n\n#### Skyborne\n\n| What | Where / Which |\n|---|---|\n| **Trainer** | Genn Fairweather, west of Valanaar, Zephras Isle (`53.8, 81.2`) |\n| **Mounts** | Genn sells the mounts too |\n| **Level 40 (60%)** | [Empyrean Galestrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=269681), [Stormy Galestrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=269683), [Umber Galestrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274930) |\n| **Level 60 (100%)** | [Swift Empyrean Galestrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=269671), [Swift Stormy Galestrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=269678), [Swift Umber Galestrider](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274933) |\n\n💡 Skyborne currently always get the Honored discount on training.\n\n---\n\n📦 Costs, trainers and mounts from [Wowhead Forever](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/unlocking-riding-skill-mounts), names and ids checked against this site's item database. Checked November 24, 2026."
