    "id": "guide-shendralar-reputation",
    "title": "Shen'dralar Reputation: Class Books, Arcanum Costs and the Dire Maul Library",
    "category": "Dungeons & Raids",
    "source": "Wowhead Forever · Auction House scan · item database",
    "icon": "https://render.worldofwarcraft.com/us/icons/56/inv_misc_book_09.jpg",
    "summary": "Reaching the Dire Maul library, class book trinkets, what each Arcanum costs to make today, Enchanted Thorium plans and the Dawn Waker link.",
    "content": "### Overview\n\nThe **Shen'dralar** are the last Highborne of Eldre'Thalas, in the Athenaeum library of Dire Maul. There is no quartermaster ladder: the value is in what the turn-ins give you.\n\n| Source | Reputation |\n|---|---|\n| **Class book** (once per character) | 500 |\n| **Libram turn-in** (repeatable) | 200 |\n| **Enchanted Thorium book** | 200 |\n| **Quel'Serrar chain** (Warrior, Paladin) | 1,000 in Classic; the sword is not confirmed in Forever |\n\n💡 Chasing the [Dawn Waker](#guides/guide-dawn-waker-secret)? One player reached Honored and Prince Tortheldrin said nothing new, so don't grind reputation only for the secret.\n\n---\n\n### Getting to the Library\n\n- **Dire Maul North (easiest):** up the ramp by Guard Mol'dar, near the entrance, with very little fighting.\n- **Dire Maul West:** through the north-east exit of Immol'thar's room.\n- **Doors:** [Crescent Key](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18249), a Rogue with 275 lockpicking (or pickpocket Mol'dar), an Engineer's [Powerful Seaforium Charge](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18594) or a Blacksmith's [Arcanite Skeleton Key](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=15872).\n\nFull routes: [Dire Maul guide](#guides/guide-dungeon-dire-maul).\n\n---\n\n### Class Books and Trinkets\n\nBooks drop from Dire Maul enemies and from A Dusty Tome inside. Each gives your class's Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas. Some seals have not been seen in Forever yet.\n\n| Class | Book | Quest | Trinket | AH Price (Book) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **Warrior** | [Codex of Defense](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18357) | [Turn in](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7499) | [Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18466) | 34g 50s |\n| **Paladin** (Alliance quest) | [The Light and How to Swing It](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18359) | [Turn in](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7501) | [Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18472) | 26g 3s |\n| **Hunter** | [The Greatest Race of Hunters](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18361) | [Turn in](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7503) | [Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18473) (+10 Agi) | 50g |\n| **Rogue** | [Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18356) | [Turn in](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7498) | [Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18465) (+10 Hit) | 15g 62s |\n| **Priest** | [Holy Bologna: What the Light Won't Tell You](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18362) | [Turn in](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7504) | [Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18469) | 55g |\n| **Shaman** (Horde quest) | [Frost Shock and You](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18363) | [Turn in](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7505) | [Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18471) | 41g 99s |\n| **Mage** | [The Arcanist's Cookbook](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18358) | [Turn in](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7500) | [Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18468) (+4 MP5) | 19g 30s |\n| **Warlock** | [Harnessing Shadows](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18360) | [Turn in](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7502) | [Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18467) | 85g 30s |\n| **Druid** | [The Emerald Dream](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18364) | [Turn in](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7506) | [Royal Seal of Eldre'Thalas](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18470) | 115g |\n\n---\n\n### Librams: Head and Leg Enchants\n\nFirst finish **Elven Legends** at the Skeletal Remains in the Athenaeum: [Alliance](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7482), from Scholar Runethorn in Feathermoon Stronghold, or [Horde](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7481), from Sage Korolusk in Camp Mojache. Then turn librams in to **Lorekeeper Lydros**.\n\n| Enchant | Materials | Cost |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Arcanum of Rapidity](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18329) ([quest](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7483)) | 1× [Libram of Rapidity](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18332), 1× [Pristine Black Diamond](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18335), 2× [Large Brilliant Shard](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=14344), 2× [Blood of Heroes](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12938) | **23g 77s** + 2× [Blood of Heroes](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12938) |\n| [Arcanum of Focus](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18330) ([quest](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7484)) | 1× [Libram of Focus](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18333), 1× [Pristine Black Diamond](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18335), 4× [Large Brilliant Shard](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=14344), 2× [Skin of Shadow](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12753) | **37g 12s** + 2× [Skin of Shadow](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12753) |\n| [Arcanum of Protection](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18331) ([quest](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7485)) | 1× [Libram of Protection](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18334), 1× [Pristine Black Diamond](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18335), 2× [Large Brilliant Shard](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=14344), 1× [Frayed Abomination Stitching](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12735) | **24g 22s** + 1× [Frayed Abomination Stitching](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12735) |\n\n📦 Costs add 14-day medians (PvE Horde, scanned November 23, 2026); anything after the + was not on the Auction House. Rare materials swing a lot, so check before you commit.\n\n---\n\n### Enchanted Thorium Plans (Armorsmith Blacksmiths)\n\nCombine both halves of a book and bring it to Lydros.\n\n| Plans | Top Half | Bottom Half |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Plans: Enchanted Thorium Breastplate](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12727) | King Gordok, Dire Maul North | Goraluk Anvilcrack, Lower Blackrock Spire |\n| [Plans: Enchanted Thorium Leggings](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12726) | Rattlegore, Scholomance | Crimson Hammersmith, Stratholme (Live) |\n| [Plans: Enchanted Thorium Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12725) | Urok Doomhowl, Lower Blackrock Spire | Black Guard Swordsmith, Stratholme (Undead) |\n\nTailors: the Shen'dralar Provisioner in the library sells [Pattern: Mooncloth Robe](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18487) in limited supply. No reputation needed.\n\n📦 Turn-ins from [Wowhead Forever](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/reputation/shendralar-reputation-faction-location-rewards), prices from this site. Checked November 24, 2026."
